module 'DAC MCP4725' Output
author 'Luis Mateos - @proyectonoise and MicroBlocks'
version 2 4 
tags dac mcp4725 
description 'MCP 4725 12-bit digital to analog converter

This library uses a default I2C address of 96 (0x60) but different I2C addresses can be supplied as an optional parameter.

I2C addresses for some popular MCP 4725 breakout boards (with A0 pin not connected):
  SparkFun: 96 (0x60)
  Adafruit: 98 (0x62)

https://www.microchip.com/en-us/product/mcp4725
'
variables '_mcp4725 out' 

  spec ' ' 'mcp4725 write' 'write _ (0-4095) to MCP4725 DAC : I2C address _' 'num num' 2048 96
  advanced
  spec ' ' 'mcp4725_setEEPROM' 'mcp4725 set EEPROM to _ millivolts : I2C address _' 'num num' 0 96

to 'mcp4725 write' value optionalAddress {
  comment 'Send a two-byte "fast mode write" command as shown in Figure 6.1
of the data sheet:
  https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/devicedoc/22039d.pdf
First data byte contains the top four bits of the 12-bit DAC value.
Second data byte contains the lower 8 bits.'
  local 'i2cAddr' (argOrDefault 2 96)
  if ((v '_mcp4725 out') == 0) {
    '_mcp4725 out' = (newList 2)
  }
  value = (maximum 0 (minimum value 4095))
  atPut 1 (v '_mcp4725 out') ((value >> 8) & 15)
  atPut 2 (v '_mcp4725 out') (value & 255)
  '[sensors:i2cWrite]' i2cAddr (v '_mcp4725 out')
}

to mcp4725_setEEPROM millivolts optionalAddress {
  comment 'Set the EEPROM value, which deterines the voltage of the MPC4725 DAC at power up.'
  comment 'Send a three-byte "write DAC register and EEPROM" command
as shown in Figure 6.2 of the data sheet:
  https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/devicedoc/22039d.pdf
First data byte contains the command.
Second byte contains top eight bits of the 12-bit DAC value.
Third data byte contains the lower 4 bits of the DAC value shifted left four bits.'
  local 'i2cAddr' (argOrDefault 2 96)
  local 'level' ((4095 * millivolts) / 3300)
  level = (maximum 0 (minimum level 4095))
  local 'cmd' ('[data:makeList]' (hexToInt '60') ((level >> 4) & 255) ((level & 15) << 4))
  '[sensors:i2cWrite]' i2cAddr cmd
}

